  "entity_raw": {
    "name_raw": "Spiritual Guardian",
    "definition_type_raw": null,
    "source_book_raw": "Advanced Class Guide pg. 157",
    "definition_raw": "Source Advanced Class Guide pg. 157\nYour spiritual guardians are more powerful than those of most others.\n\nPrerequisites: Ability to cast spiritual weapon or spiritual ally, spirit magic class feature.\n\nBenefit: Whenever you cast spiritual weapon, spiritual ally, or a similar spell that grants you a spiritual guardian, that guardian uses your shaman level instead of your base attack bonus to determine its base attack bonus, potentially granting it multiple attacks. Additionally, it gains a +2 bonus on caster level checks to overcome spell resistance as well as on damage rolls.",
